{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/mn3/quest_story/10137010.json":{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10137010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10137010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1013701001:0":{"text":"太陽の神殿のシルエットが見えてきましたよ。地下通路を選んで正解でしたね！","source_cn":"从地下通道出来后，确实能看到日神殿的轮廓了，看来没走错路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EB32F5DB3FF36BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013701002:0":{"text":"これも案内人のアタシのおかげだな。","source_cn":"也不看看你们的向导是谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABAE599354A0A605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013701003:0":{"text":"あら、井戸の底の通路を見つけたのはアタランテさんではなくて、マスターだったはずですよ！","source_cn":"可我记得找到井底通道的并不是阿塔兰忒，而是主人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F458A81F772804","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あら、井戸の底の通路を見つけたのはアタランテさんではなくて、マスターだったはずですよ！","female":"あら、井戸の底の通路を見つけたのはアタランテさんではなくて、マスターだったはずですよ！","variant_male_record_index":"113778","variant_female_record_index":"113779","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"ルシウス","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"アタランテ","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/mn3/quest_story/10137020.json":{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10137020","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10137020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013702001:1":{"text":"ん？待ってください、この先から何か聞こえますよ……","source_cn":"等等，停一下。听，前面有声音……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DE6B6AED8BD69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013702002:1":{"text":"いいぞ、強者たる者、常に警戒心を解くべからず。また会ったな我がライバルよ。","source_cn":"呵，不错，保持警觉是强者的修养。又见到你们了，我的对手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE98448BAEDD591E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013702003:1":{"text":"度々俺の前に現れるとは、俺との手合わせが恋しくなったか？いいぞ、それでこそ血が滾るというものだ！","source_cn":"你不断出现在我面前，是在怀念与我切磋的感觉吗？真是热血...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBB757BEB0FBB0892","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"度々俺の前に現れるとは、俺との手合わせが恋しくなったか？いいぞ、それでこそ血が滾るというものだ！","female":"度々俺の前に現れるとは、俺との手合わせが恋しくなったか？いいぞ、それでこそ血が滾るというものだ！","variant_male_record_index":"113782","variant_female_record_index":"113783","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013702004:1":{"text":"お前の魔法に首を締め付けられるあの感覚が蘇ってきたぞ！さあ、俺のキャンプで一戦交えようじゃないか！","source_cn":"我几乎能感受到你的魔咒勒紧我咽喉的感觉，去我的营地再战...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA5965793595DB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"お前の魔法に首を締め付けられるあの感覚が蘇ってきたぞ！さあ、俺のキャンプで一戦交えようじゃないか！","female":"お前の魔法に首を締め付けられるあの感覚が蘇ってきたぞ！さあ、俺のキャンプで一戦交えようじゃないか！","variant_male_record_index":"113784","variant_female_record_index":"113785","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013702005:1":{"text":"なんて理不尽なっ！性懲りもなく私たちに会いに来てるのはそっちでしょう！","source_cn":"这家伙好不讲道理……明明是你不断出现在我们面前好不好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF661536E504B3636","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013702006:1":{"text":"これは俺の予感だが、俺の所に来れば、お前たちの探しているもののヒントが得られるぞ。","source_cn":"我有一种预感，你们所追寻的东西能在我那里获得启示。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50C675A9C24D7DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"ルシウス","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"シャキール","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/mn3/quest_story/10137030.json":{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10137030","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10137030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1013703001:0":{"text":"さあ、始めようか！我がライバルよ！","source_cn":"开战吧，我的对手！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75C284C7CD3AEB4E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"さあ、始めようか！我がライバルよ！","female":"さあ、始めようか！我がライバルよ！","variant_male_record_index":"113788","variant_female_record_index":"113789","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013703002:0":{"text":"ま、待ってくださいよ。今着いたばかりなんですよ！","source_cn":"停停停，我们才刚过来而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE1D94CF6DEC08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title